# 🌿 LUMÉA – Skincare E-Commerce Website ( Intermidate Level )

## 📌 Project Overview

LUMÉA is a modern and responsive skincare e-commerce website designed as an Intermediate Level UI/UX project.

The website provides users with a simple and attractive shopping experience where they can explore skincare products, view product details, add products to their cart, create a skincare routine, and proceed to checkout.

The project focuses on clean design, easy navigation, consistent branding, and a user-friendly shopping experience.

---

## 🎯 Objective

The main objective of this project is to design a professional skincare e-commerce experience that demonstrates:

- UI/UX design principles
- User-friendly navigation
- Responsive design
- Consistent design system
- Interactive prototype
- Product discovery
- Shopping and checkout flow
- Modern visual design

